{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":5,"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","version":"3.10.0"},"colab":{"provenance":[],"gpuType":"A100","machine_shape":"hm"},"accelerator":"GPU"},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-0","metadata":{"id":"cell-0"},"source":["# Phase 9-C Step 2: LLMモデル変更評価\n","\n","**作成日**: 2026-02-26\n","**プロジェクト**: experiments-local-llm\n","**目的**: LLMモデル変更（Qwen2.5-7B → Qwen3-32B）による回答品質改善の効果測定 (C1 vs C2)\n","\n","---\n","\n","## 実験設計\n","\n","| ID | 構成 | プロンプト | モデル | 対象 |\n","|----|------|-----------|--------|------|\n","| **C1** | ベースライン | 改善版 (Step 1) | Qwen2.5-7B 4bit | Phase 9-C Step 1結果から取得 |\n","| **C2** | Step 2 | 改善版 (Step 1) | **Qwen3-32B 4bit** | 本ノートブックで評価 |\n","\n","## 変更点\n","\n","- **モデル**: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 4bit → **Qwen3-32B** (bitsandbytes NF4 4bit)\n","- **生成パラメータ**: Qwen3推奨値 (temperature=0.7, top_p=0.8, top_k=20)\n","- **enable_thinking**: **False** (非思考モード、C1との公正比較)\n","- **プロンプト**: C1と完全に同一（変数はモデルのみ）\n","\n","## 実行環境\n","\n","- **GPU**: A100 (Colab Pro) — 40GB or 80GB VRAM\n","- Qwen3-32B 4bit: ロード時ピーク ~22-25GB、推論時 ~18GB\n","- L4 (22GB) では OOM のため A100 が必要\n","\n","## 目標値\n","\n","| 指標 | C1実績 | C2目標 | 根拠 |\n","|------|--------|--------|------|\n","| composite | 67.1 | **70+** | モデル能力向上で+3pt |\n","| reasoning | 2.65 | **3.0+** | 32Bモデルの推論力 |\n","| evidence | 3.71 | **3.5+** (維持) | プロンプト効果を維持 |\n","| success% | 76.2% | **80%+** | composite底上げ |"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-1","metadata":{"id":"cell-1"},"source":["## 0. リポジトリ同期（作業ブランチの最新化）\n","\n","Google Drive上のリポジトリを作業ブランチ (`feature/phase9c-step2-model`) の最新状態に同期する。\n","\n","**注意**:\n","- GitHub PAT（Personal Access Token）の入力が必要（SSH非対応のため）\n","- ローカルの未コミット変更がある場合は stash される"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-2","metadata":{"id":"cell-2"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# --- リポジトリを作業ブランチの最新状態に同期 ---\n","import os\n","import sys\n","\n","# Colab環境の場合のみ実行\n","if 'google.colab' in sys.modules:\n","    from google.colab import drive\n","    if not os.path.ismount('/content/drive'):\n","        drive.mount('/content/drive')\n","\n","REPO_PATH = '/content/drive/MyDrive/experiments-local-llm'\n","BRANCH = 'feature/phase9c-step2-model'\n","\n","print(f\"Repository: {REPO_PATH}\")\n","print(f\"Target branch: {BRANCH}\")\n","print()\n","\n","# --- GitHub PAT認証（ColabではSSHが使えないためHTTPS+PATを使用）---\n","from getpass import getpass\n","github_token = getpass(\"GitHub Personal Access Token: \")\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} remote set-url origin https://{github_token}@github.com/mopinfish/experiments-local-llm.git\n","print(\"GitHub HTTPS authentication configured\")\n","print()\n","\n","# Git設定（Colab上で初回のみ必要）\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} config user.name \"colab-runner\"\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} config user.email \"colab@example.com\"\n","\n","# 現在のブランチとステータスを確認\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} branch --show-current\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} status --short\n","print()\n","\n","# ローカルの未コミット変更を退避\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} stash --include-untracked -m \"auto-stash before sync\"\n","\n","# リモートの最新を取得\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} fetch origin\n","\n","# 作業ブランチに切り替え（既にいる場合は何もしない）\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} checkout {BRANCH}\n","\n","# リモートの最新に同期\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} pull origin {BRANCH}\n","\n","# 退避した変更を戻す（あれば）\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} stash pop 2>/dev/null || echo \"No stash to pop\"\n","\n","print()\n","print(\"=\" * 60)\n","# 同期後の状態を表示\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} log --oneline -5\n","print()\n","!git -C {REPO_PATH} branch --show-current\n","print(\"=\" * 60)\n","print(\"\\n\" + chr(0x2705) + \" リポジトリ同期完了\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-3","metadata":{"id":"cell-3"},"source":["## 1. 環境セットアップ"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-4","metadata":{"id":"cell-4"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# Google Colab環境チェック\n","import sys\n","import os\n","IN_COLAB = 'google.colab' in sys.modules\n","\n","if IN_COLAB:\n","    from google.colab import drive\n","    drive.mount('/content/drive')\n","\n","    PROJECT_PATH = '/content/drive/MyDrive/experiments-local-llm'\n","    sys.path.insert(0, f'{PROJECT_PATH}/src')\n","\n","    # Qwen3-32B対応の依存関係（bitsandbytes NF4量子化、Step 1と同方式）\n","    !pip install -q -U \"transformers>=4.51.0\"\n","    !pip install -q accelerate bitsandbytes chromadb sentence-transformers\n","    !pip install -q langchain langchain-core langchain-community langchain-chroma langgraph\n","    !pip install -q matplotlib seaborn pandas numpy tqdm\n","else:\n","    PROJECT_PATH = '..'\n","    sys.path.insert(0, f'{PROJECT_PATH}/src')\n","\n","# 結果ディレクトリ\n","os.makedirs(f'{PROJECT_PATH}/results', exist_ok=True)\n","\n","# GPU確認\n","import torch\n","print(f\"PyTorch version: {torch.__version__}\")\n","print(f\"CUDA available: {torch.cuda.is_available()}\")\n","if torch.cuda.is_available():\n","    gpu_name = torch.cuda.get_device_name(0)\n","    vram_total = torch.cuda.get_device_properties(0).total_memory / 1024**3\n","    print(f\"GPU: {gpu_name}\")\n","    print(f\"VRAM: {vram_total:.1f} GB\")\n","\n","print(f\"\\nProject path: {PROJECT_PATH}\")\n","print(f\"Running in Colab: {IN_COLAB}\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-5","metadata":{"id":"cell-5"},"source":["## 2. VRAM検証 + Qwen3-32B ロード\n","\n","**モデル**: `Qwen/Qwen3-32B` (bitsandbytes NF4 4-bit量子化)\n","**必要VRAM**: ロード時ピーク ~22-25GB、推論時 ~18GB\n","**必須GPU**: A100 40GB以上（L4 22GBでは不足）\n","\n","### GPU選択手順（Colab Pro）\n","1. **Runtime > Change runtime type** を開く\n","2. **GPU** を選択\n","3. **A100** を明示的に選択（「高性能」や自動選択ではなく、A100を指定）\n","4. **Save** → ランタイムを再起動\n","\n","**重要**: Colab Proでも自動選択ではL4が割り当てられることがあります。\n","A100を明示的に指定してください。VRAM 30GB未満の場合はエラーで停止します。"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-6","metadata":{"id":"cell-6"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["from transformers import AutoTokenizer, AutoModelForCausalLM, BitsAndBytesConfig\n","import warnings\n","import gc\n","warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n","\n","# 再実行時のVRAMクリーンアップ\n","for var_name in ['model', 'tokenizer']:\n","    if var_name in dir():\n","        try:\n","            del globals()[var_name]\n","        except KeyError:\n","            pass\n","gc.collect()\n","if torch.cuda.is_available():\n","    torch.cuda.empty_cache()\n","    print(f\"VRAM before load: {torch.cuda.memory_allocated() / 1024**3:.2f} GB\")\n","\n","# --- HFキャッシュクリーンアップ（ディスク容量確保）---\n","import shutil, os\n","hf_cache = os.path.expanduser(\"~/.cache/huggingface/hub\")\n","if os.path.exists(hf_cache):\n","    cache_size = sum(\n","        os.path.getsize(os.path.join(dp, f))\n","        for dp, dn, fns in os.walk(hf_cache) for f in fns\n","    ) / 1e9\n","    print(f\"HF cache size: {cache_size:.1f}GB\")\n","    if cache_size > 30:\n","        shutil.rmtree(hf_cache)\n","        print(\"Cleared HF cache to free disk space\")\n","\n","# --- GPU検証（A100必須）---\n","gpu_name = torch.cuda.get_device_name(0)\n","vram_total = torch.cuda.get_device_properties(0).total_memory / 1e9\n","print(f\"GPU: {gpu_name}, VRAM: {vram_total:.1f}GB\")\n","\n","if vram_total < 30:\n","    raise RuntimeError(\n","        f\"\\n{'='*60}\\n\"\n","        f\"ERROR: VRAM {vram_total:.0f}GB は Qwen3-32B に不足しています。\\n\"\n","        f\"現在のGPU: {gpu_name}\\n\\n\"\n","        f\"Qwen3-32B には A100 (40GB+) が必要です。\\n\\n\"\n","        f\"修正手順:\\n\"\n","        f\"  1. Runtime > Change runtime type\\n\"\n","        f\"  2. GPU を選択\\n\"\n","        f\"  3. A100 を明示的に選択\\n\"\n","        f\"  4. Save → ランタイムを再起動\\n\"\n","        f\"  5. 全セルを最初から再実行\\n\"\n","        f\"{'='*60}\"\n","    )\n","\n","print(f\"GPU check passed: {gpu_name} ({vram_total:.0f}GB)\")\n","\n","# --- 4bit量子化設定 (Step 1と同方式) ---\n","bnb_config = BitsAndBytesConfig(\n","    load_in_4bit=True,\n","    bnb_4bit_quant_type=\"nf4\",\n","    bnb_4bit_compute_dtype=torch.float16,\n","    bnb_4bit_use_double_quant=True\n",")\n","\n","# --- モデルロード (Qwen3-32B のみ、フォールバックなし) ---\n","MODEL_ID = \"Qwen/Qwen3-32B\"\n","model_id = MODEL_ID\n","print(f\"\\nLoading {model_id} (4-bit NF4 quantized)...\")\n","\n","tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_id, trust_remote_code=True)\n","print(\"Tokenizer loaded\")\n","\n","model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\n","    model_id,\n","    quantization_config=bnb_config,\n","    device_map=\"auto\",\n","    trust_remote_code=True\n",")\n","print(f\"Model loaded: {model_id}\")\n","\n","# VRAM使用量確認\n","vram_used = torch.cuda.memory_allocated() / 1e9\n","print(f\"\\nVRAM used: {vram_used:.1f}GB / {vram_total:.1f}GB\")\n","print(f\"VRAM remaining: {vram_total - vram_used:.1f}GB\")\n","print(f\"\\n{chr(0x2705)} Model ID: {model_id}\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-7","metadata":{"id":"cell-7"},"source":["## 3. Qwen3 非思考モード + 生成パラメータ設定\n","\n","Qwen3のthinking modeを無効化し、C1 (Qwen2.5-7B) との公正比較を実現。\n","\n","**方法**:\n","1. `tokenizer.apply_chat_template` に `enable_thinking=False` を注入\n","2. テンプレート出力に `<think>` が残る場合はテキストレベルで除去\n","3. `model.generate` にQwen3推奨パラメータを注入\n","\n","`src/` のコードは変更しない — すべてノートブック内のmonkey-patchで対応。"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-8","metadata":{"id":"cell-8"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# --- 非思考モード: tokenizer.apply_chat_templateをパッチ ---\n","# enable_thinking=False を渡し、さらにテンプレート出力から <think> を除去\n","\n","original_apply_chat_template = tokenizer.apply_chat_template\n","\n","def patched_apply_chat_template(*args, **kwargs):\n","    \"\"\"Qwen3の思考モードを無効化するパッチ\"\"\"\n","    kwargs['enable_thinking'] = False\n","    result = original_apply_chat_template(*args, **kwargs)\n","    # テンプレートに <think> が残る場合はテキストレベルで除去\n","    if isinstance(result, str) and '<think>' in result:\n","        result = result.replace('<think>\\n', '')\n","        result = result.replace('<think>', '')\n","    return result\n","\n","tokenizer.apply_chat_template = patched_apply_chat_template\n","print(\"Patched tokenizer.apply_chat_template (non-thinking mode)\")\n","\n","# --- Qwen3推奨生成パラメータをmodel.generateに注入 ---\n","original_generate = model.generate\n","\n","def patched_generate(*args, **kwargs):\n","    \"\"\"Qwen3推奨パラメータを注入: temperature=0.7, top_p=0.8, top_k=20\"\"\"\n","    kwargs['temperature'] = 0.7\n","    kwargs['top_p'] = 0.8\n","    kwargs['top_k'] = 20\n","    kwargs['do_sample'] = True\n","    return original_generate(*args, **kwargs)\n","\n","model.generate = patched_generate\n","print(\"Patched model.generate with Qwen3 params (temperature=0.7, top_p=0.8, top_k=20)\")\n","\n","# --- 動作確認 ---\n","test_messages = [\n","    {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a helpful assistant.\"},\n","    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"}\n","]\n","test_output = tokenizer.apply_chat_template(\n","    test_messages, tokenize=False, add_generation_prompt=True\n",")\n","print(f\"\\nTemplate output (last 100 chars):\")\n","print(repr(test_output[-100:]))\n","\n","if '<think>' in test_output:\n","    print(\"WARNING: <think> still in template (will be handled at generation)\")\n","else:\n","    print(chr(0x2705) + \" No <think> in template output\")\n","print(chr(0x2705) + \" Qwen3 generation params configured\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-9","metadata":{"id":"cell-9"},"source":["## 4. 埋め込みモデル（multilingual-e5-base）"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-10","metadata":{"id":"cell-10"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["from sentence_transformers import SentenceTransformer\n","from langchain_community.embeddings import HuggingFaceEmbeddings\n","\n","embedding_model_name = \"intfloat/multilingual-e5-base\"\n","print(f\"Loading embedding model: {embedding_model_name}...\")\n","\n","embeddings = HuggingFaceEmbeddings(\n","    model_name=embedding_model_name,\n","    model_kwargs={'device': 'cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu'},\n","    encode_kwargs={'normalize_embeddings': True}\n",")\n","print(\"Embedding model loaded\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-11","metadata":{"id":"cell-11"},"source":["## 5. POIデータ読み込み（4エリア + combined）"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-12","metadata":{"id":"cell-12"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["import json\n","from geo_utils import STATIONS, AREA_STATION_MAP, enrich_all_areas\n","\n","# エリア設定\n","areas_config = {\n","    \"shibuya\": {\n","        \"name\": \"渋谷駅周辺\",\n","        \"station\": STATIONS[\"渋谷駅\"]\n","    },\n","    \"shinjuku\": {\n","        \"name\": \"新宿駅周辺\",\n","        \"station\": STATIONS[\"新宿駅\"]\n","    },\n","    \"ikebukuro\": {\n","        \"name\": \"池袋駅周辺\",\n","        \"station\": STATIONS[\"池袋駅\"]\n","    },\n","    \"tokyo\": {\n","        \"name\": \"東京駅周辺\",\n","        \"station\": STATIONS[\"東京駅\"]\n","    }\n","}\n","\n","# 統合POIデータ読み込み\n","poi_all_file = f\"{PROJECT_PATH}/data/poi_all_areas.json\"\n","print(f\"Loading POI data from {poi_all_file}...\")\n","\n","with open(poi_all_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n","    raw_pois = json.load(f)\n","\n","# メタデータをフラット化\n","flat_pois = []\n","for poi in raw_pois:\n","    if \"metadata\" in poi:\n","        flat_poi = poi[\"metadata\"].copy()\n","        flat_pois.append(flat_poi)\n","    else:\n","        flat_pois.append(poi)\n","\n","print(f\"Total raw POIs: {len(flat_pois)}\")\n","\n","# エリア別POI数を表示\n","area_counts = {}\n","for poi in flat_pois:\n","    area_key = poi.get(\"area_key\", \"unknown\")\n","    area_counts[area_key] = area_counts.get(area_key, 0) + 1\n","\n","print(\"\\nPOI counts by area:\")\n","for area, count in sorted(area_counts.items()):\n","    area_name = areas_config.get(area, {}).get(\"name\", area)\n","    print(f\"  {area_name}: {count}\")\n","print(f\"  Total: {sum(area_counts.values())}\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-13","metadata":{"id":"cell-13"},"source":["## 6. ChromaDBベクトルストア構築（5コレクション）"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-14","metadata":{"id":"cell-14"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["from langchain_chroma import Chroma\n","from langchain_core.documents import Document\n","import gc\n","\n","def create_documents(pois):\n","    \"\"\"POIリストからLangChain Documentを作成\"\"\"\n","    docs = []\n","    for poi in pois:\n","        content = f\"{poi.get('name', '')} {poi.get('category', '')} {poi.get('description', '')}\"\n","        docs.append(Document(page_content=content, metadata=poi))\n","    return docs\n","\n","# エリア別 + 全統合のベクトルストア作成\n","vectorstores = {}\n","pois_by_area = {}\n","\n","for area_key in areas_config:\n","    area_pois = [p for p in flat_pois if p.get(\"area_key\") == area_key]\n","    pois_by_area[area_key] = area_pois\n","    docs = create_documents(area_pois)\n","    vectorstores[area_key] = Chroma.from_documents(\n","        documents=docs,\n","        embedding=embeddings,\n","        collection_name=f\"pois_{area_key}\"\n","    )\n","    print(f\"  {area_key}: {len(docs)} documents\")\n","\n","# 全統合コレクション\n","all_docs = create_documents(flat_pois)\n","vectorstores[\"all\"] = Chroma.from_documents(\n","    documents=all_docs,\n","    embedding=embeddings,\n","    collection_name=\"pois_all\"\n",")\n","print(f\"  all: {len(all_docs)} documents\")\n","\n","print(\"\\nVectorstore construction complete\")\n","gc.collect()\n","if torch.cuda.is_available():\n","    torch.cuda.empty_cache()\n","    print(f\"VRAM after cleanup: {torch.cuda.memory_allocated() / 1024**3:.2f} GB\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-15","metadata":{"id":"cell-15"},"source":["## 7. POI空間情報付与（enrich_all_areas）"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-16","metadata":{"id":"cell-16"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["from geo_utils import enrich_all_areas\n","\n","# 全POIに空間情報を付与\n","all_pois_enriched = enrich_all_areas(flat_pois, areas_config)\n","print(f\"Enriched {len(all_pois_enriched)} POIs with spatial info\")\n","\n","# エリア別にも保持\n","enriched_by_area = {}\n","for poi in all_pois_enriched:\n","    area_key = poi.get(\"area_key\", \"unknown\")\n","    enriched_by_area.setdefault(area_key, []).append(poi)\n","\n","for area_key, area_pois in sorted(enriched_by_area.items()):\n","    if area_pois:\n","        avg_dist = sum(p.get(\"distance_from_station\", 0) for p in area_pois) / len(area_pois)\n","        print(f\"  {area_key}: {len(area_pois)} POIs, avg distance: {avg_dist:.0f}m\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-17","metadata":{"id":"cell-17"},"source":["## 8. テストケース読み込み"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-18","metadata":{"id":"cell-18"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["from test_cases_multi_area import (\n","    ALL_MULTI_AREA_TEST_CASES,\n","    get_quick_test_cases,\n","    get_test_case_stats,\n",")\n","\n","print(f\"Total test cases: {len(ALL_MULTI_AREA_TEST_CASES)}\")\n","\n","# 統計表示\n","stats = get_test_case_stats()\n","print(f\"\\nBy area:\")\n","for area, count in stats.get('by_area', {}).items():\n","    print(f\"  {area}: {count}\")\n","\n","print(f\"\\nBy level:\")\n","for level, count in sorted(stats.get('by_level', {}).items()):\n","    print(f\"  L{level}: {count}\")\n","\n","print(f\"\\nQuick test cases: {len(get_quick_test_cases())}\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-19","metadata":{"id":"cell-19"},"source":["## 9. RAGシステム初期化（Hybrid RAG のみ、C1改善プロンプト適用済み）\n","\n","**重要**: Step 2ではモデルのみ変更。プロンプトはC1と完全に同一。\n","`structured_rag_system.py` の改善済みプロンプトがそのまま適用される。\n","\n","**評価対象**: Hybrid RAG のみ（Step 1で最高スコア・最も汎化性能が高い）"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-20","metadata":{"id":"cell-20"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["from structured_rag_system import StructuredRAGSystem\n","from geo_utils import detect_target_area\n","\n","# Hybrid RAG (StructuredRAG) - C1プロンプト + Qwen3-32Bモデル\n","print(f\"Initializing Hybrid RAG with {model_id}...\")\n","hybrid_system = StructuredRAGSystem(\n","    model=model,\n","    tokenizer=tokenizer,\n","    vectorstore=vectorstores[\"all\"],\n","    all_pois=all_pois_enriched,\n","    areas_config=areas_config,\n","    debug=False\n",")\n","print(\"Hybrid RAG initialized\")\n","\n","# C1プロンプト確認\n","assert \"結論\" in hybrid_system.system_prompt, \"C1プロンプトが適用されていません\"\n","assert \"根拠\" in hybrid_system.system_prompt, \"C1プロンプトが適用されていません\"\n","print(chr(0x2705) + \" C1プロンプト確認 OK\")\n","print(f\"{chr(0x2705)} モデル: {model_id}\")\n","\n","if torch.cuda.is_available():\n","    print(f\"\\nVRAM after init: {torch.cuda.memory_allocated() / 1024**3:.2f} GB\")"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-21","metadata":{"id":"cell-21"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# システムラッパー関数（system_fn仕様）\n","import re\n","\n","def strip_think_tags(text: str) -> str:\n","    \"\"\"Qwen3の<think>...</think>ブロックを除去\"\"\"\n","    if '<think>' in text:\n","        text = re.sub(r'<think>.*?</think>', '', text, flags=re.DOTALL).strip()\n","    return text\n","\n","def hybrid_fn(question: str) -> dict:\n","    \"\"\"Hybrid RAG system_fn wrapper (C1 prompt + Qwen3-32B)\"\"\"\n","    result = hybrid_system.query(question)\n","    detected = result.get(\"detected_area\") or detect_target_area(question)\n","    answer = strip_think_tags(result.get(\"answer\", \"\"))\n","    return {\n","        \"answer\": answer,\n","        \"detected_area\": detected,\n","    }\n","\n","print(\"hybrid_fn ready (with <think> tag cleanup)\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-22","metadata":{"id":"cell-22"},"source":["## 10. テスト推論（enable_thinking=False 確認）\n","\n","1件のクエリで正常に回答が生成されることを確認。\n","回答に `<think>` タグが含まれないことで非思考モードを検証。"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-23","metadata":{"id":"cell-23"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# テスト推論\n","import time\n","test_q = \"渋谷駅から最も近いカフェはどこですか？\"\n","print(f\"Test query: {test_q}\")\n","print()\n","\n","start = time.time()\n","test_result = hybrid_fn(test_q)\n","elapsed = time.time() - start\n","\n","answer = test_result[\"answer\"]\n","\n","# Qwen3の思考タグが回答に含まれる場合は除去\n","import re\n","if '<think>' in answer:\n","    # <think>...</think> ブロックを除去\n","    answer = re.sub(r'<think>.*?</think>', '', answer, flags=re.DOTALL).strip()\n","    test_result[\"answer\"] = answer\n","    print(\"NOTE: Removed <think>...</think> block from answer\")\n","\n","print(f\"Answer ({elapsed:.1f}s):\")\n","print(answer[:500])\n","print()\n","\n","has_think = '<think>' in answer\n","if has_think:\n","    print(\"WARNING: <think> tag still present after cleanup\")\n","else:\n","    print(chr(0x2705) + f\" Test passed: no <think> tag, {elapsed:.1f}s\")\n","print(f\"{chr(0x2705)} Detected area: {test_result['detected_area']}\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-24","metadata":{"id":"cell-24"},"source":["## 11. Quick Test実行（13件、Hybrid RAGのみ）\n","\n","C2モデルの動作確認。回答品質の初期確認。"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-25","metadata":{"id":"cell-25"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["from evaluators_multi_area import MultiAreaEvaluator\n","from tqdm import tqdm\n","import gc\n","\n","def clear_memory():\n","    \"\"\"VRAM/RAM解放\"\"\"\n","    gc.collect()\n","    if torch.cuda.is_available():\n","        torch.cuda.empty_cache()\n","\n","evaluator = MultiAreaEvaluator(areas_config=areas_config, all_pois=all_pois_enriched)\n","\n","# Quick Testケース\n","quick_cases = get_quick_test_cases()\n","print(f\"Quick Test: {len(quick_cases)} cases (Hybrid RAG only)\")\n","\n","# Hybrid RAGのみQuick Test\n","quick_results = evaluator.evaluate_all(\n","    system_name=\"hybrid_rag\",\n","    system_fn=hybrid_fn,\n","    test_cases=quick_cases\n",")\n","\n","# スコア再計算\n","quick_results = evaluator.recalculate_scores(quick_results, quick_cases)\n","\n","# サマリー表示\n","summary = evaluator.generate_summary(quick_results)\n","overall = summary[\"overall\"]\n","print(f\"\\n{'='*60}\")\n","print(f\"Quick Test Results (Hybrid RAG, C2: Qwen3-32B)\")\n","print(f\"{'='*60}\")\n","print(f\"  Success Rate:          {overall['success_rate']*100:.1f}%\")\n","print(f\"  Avg Keyword Hit Rate:  {overall['avg_keyword_hit_rate']:.3f}\")\n","print(f\"  Avg Composite Score:   {overall['avg_composite_score']:.1f}\")\n","print(f\"  Composite Success Rate:{overall['composite_success_rate']*100:.1f}%\")\n","print(f\"  Avg Reasoning Score:   {overall.get('avg_reasoning_score', 0):.2f}\")\n","print(f\"  Avg Evidence Score:    {overall.get('avg_evidence_score', 0):.2f}\")\n","print(f\"  Avg Time: {overall['avg_time_sec']:.1f}s\")\n","\n","clear_memory()"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-26","metadata":{"id":"cell-26"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# Quick Testの回答サンプル確認\n","print(\"=\"*60)\n","print(\"回答サンプル確認（C2: Qwen3-32B）\")\n","print(\"=\"*60)\n","\n","for r in quick_results[:5]:\n","    print(f\"\\n--- {r.test_id} (composite={r.composite_score}, reasoning={r.reasoning_score}, evidence={r.evidence_score}) ---\")\n","    print(f\"Q: {r.test_id}\")\n","    answer_preview = r.answer[:500] if r.answer else \"(no answer)\"\n","    print(f\"A: {answer_preview}\")\n","    print()"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-27","metadata":{"id":"cell-27"},"source":["## 12. Full Test実行: C2 Hybrid RAG × 130件（主評価）\n","\n","**注意**: 130ケースの評価には約1-2時間かかります（Qwen3-32Bのため少し長めの可能性あり）。\n","チェックポイント付きなので、中断後の再開が可能です。"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-28","metadata":{"id":"cell-28"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["run_full_test = True  # Full Testを実行\n","\n","full_results = {}\n","\n","if run_full_test:\n","    all_cases = ALL_MULTI_AREA_TEST_CASES\n","\n","    # === 主評価: Hybrid RAG × 130件 ===\n","    print(f\"{'='*60}\")\n","    print(f\"C2 Evaluation: hybrid_rag ({len(all_cases)} cases)\")\n","    print(f\"Model: {model_id}\")\n","    print(f\"{'='*60}\")\n","\n","    # 前回の14B結果チェックポイントを削除（32Bで再評価を強制）\n","    checkpoint = f\"{PROJECT_PATH}/results/checkpoint_c2_hybrid_rag.json\"\n","    if os.path.exists(checkpoint):\n","        # チェックポイントのモデルIDを確認\n","        import json as _json\n","        with open(checkpoint, 'r') as _f:\n","            _cp_data = _json.load(_f)\n","        # チェックポイントが存在する場合、モデルIDが異なれば削除\n","        _cp_model = None\n","        if isinstance(_cp_data, list) and len(_cp_data) > 0:\n","            _cp_model = \"checkpoint exists\"\n","        if model_id == \"Qwen/Qwen3-32B\":\n","            # 32Bで再評価するため、既存チェックポイント（14B結果）を削除\n","            os.remove(checkpoint)\n","            print(f\"Deleted old checkpoint (forcing fresh 32B evaluation)\")\n","\n","    results = evaluator.evaluate_all(\n","        system_name=\"hybrid_rag\",\n","        system_fn=hybrid_fn,\n","        test_cases=all_cases,\n","        checkpoint_file=checkpoint\n","    )\n","    full_results[\"hybrid_rag\"] = results\n","\n","    summary = evaluator.generate_summary(results)\n","    overall = summary[\"overall\"]\n","    print(f\"\\n  Success Rate: {overall['success_rate']*100:.1f}%\")\n","    print(f\"  Avg Hit Rate: {overall['avg_keyword_hit_rate']:.3f}\")\n","    print(f\"  Avg Time: {overall['avg_time_sec']:.1f}s\")\n","\n","    clear_memory()\n","    print(\"\\nHybrid RAG evaluation complete!\")\n","else:\n","    print(\"Full Test skipped (set run_full_test = True to run)\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-29","metadata":{"id":"cell-29"},"source":["## 13. 事後スコア計算（多次元評価）"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-30","metadata":{"id":"cell-30"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# 事後スコア計算（既存チェックポイント結果に多次元スコアを付与）\n","from test_cases_multi_area import ALL_MULTI_AREA_TEST_CASES\n","\n","for sys_name, results in full_results.items():\n","    full_results[sys_name] = evaluator.recalculate_scores(results, ALL_MULTI_AREA_TEST_CASES)\n","    sample = full_results[sys_name][0]\n","    print(f\"{sys_name}: composite={sample.composite_score}, reasoning={sample.reasoning_score}, \"\n","          f\"evidence={sample.evidence_score}, constraint={sample.constraint_score}\")\n","\n","print(\"\\nMulti-dimensional scores recalculated\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-31","metadata":{"id":"cell-31"},"source":["## 14. C1ベースライン読み込み（Phase 9-C Step 1結果）\n","\n","Step 1の評価結果をC1ベースラインとして読み込み、C2との差分を比較。"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-32","metadata":{"id":"cell-32"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["import glob\n","\n","# Phase 9-C Step 1の結果ファイルを検索\n","c1_files = sorted(glob.glob(f\"{PROJECT_PATH}/results/phase9c_step1_2*.json\"))\n","if c1_files:\n","    c1_file = c1_files[-1]  # 最新の結果を使用\n","    print(f\"Loading C1 baseline from: {c1_file}\")\n","\n","    with open(c1_file, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n","        c1_data = json.load(f)\n","\n","    # C1のhybrid_ragサマリー抽出\n","    c1_summary = c1_data[\"systems\"][\"hybrid_rag\"][\"summary\"]\n","    c1_overall = c1_summary[\"overall\"]\n","\n","    print(f\"\\nC1 baseline loaded:\")\n","    print(f\"  Model: {c1_data.get('model', 'N/A')}\")\n","    print(f\"  Test count: {c1_data.get('test_count', 'N/A')}\")\n","    print(f\"  Prompt: {c1_data.get('prompt_version', 'N/A')}\")\n","\n","    # C1サマリー表示\n","    print(f\"\\n{'='*60}\")\n","    print(f\"C1 Baseline (Hybrid RAG)\")\n","    print(f\"{'='*60}\")\n","    print(f\"  Composite Score:   {c1_overall['avg_composite_score']:.1f}\")\n","    print(f\"  Reasoning Score:   {c1_overall.get('avg_reasoning_score', 0):.2f}\")\n","    print(f\"  Evidence Score:    {c1_overall.get('avg_evidence_score', 0):.2f}\")\n","    print(f\"  Success Rate:      {c1_overall['success_rate']*100:.1f}%\")\n","    print(f\"  Composite Success: {c1_overall['composite_success_rate']*100:.1f}%\")\n","else:\n","    print(\"WARNING: No Phase 9-C Step 1 results found!\")\n","    print(\"Expected files matching: results/phase9c_step1_2*.json\")\n","    c1_summary = None\n","    c1_overall = None"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-33","metadata":{"id":"cell-33"},"source":["## 15. C1 vs C2 比較分析（メイン結果）"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-34","metadata":{"id":"cell-34"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","\n","# C2サマリー生成\n","c2_summary = evaluator.generate_summary(full_results[\"hybrid_rag\"])\n","c2_overall = c2_summary[\"overall\"]\n","\n","# === C1 vs C2 比較表 ===\n","print(\"=\"*80)\n","print(\"C1 (Qwen2.5-7B) vs C2 (Qwen3-32B) Comparison - Hybrid RAG\")\n","print(\"=\"*80)\n","\n","if c1_overall:\n","    metrics = [\n","        (\"success_rate\", \"Success Rate\", 100, \"%\"),\n","        (\"avg_composite_score\", \"Composite Score\", 1, \"\"),\n","        (\"composite_success_rate\", \"Composite Success%\", 100, \"%\"),\n","        (\"avg_reasoning_score\", \"Reasoning Score\", 1, \"\"),\n","        (\"avg_evidence_score\", \"Evidence Score\", 1, \"\"),\n","        (\"avg_keyword_hit_rate\", \"Keyword Hit Rate\", 100, \"%\"),\n","        (\"avg_time_sec\", \"Avg Time (sec)\", 1, \"s\"),\n","    ]\n","\n","    print(f\"\\n{'Metric':<25} {'C1 (7B)':>10} {'C2 (32B)':>10} {'Delta':>10} {'Status':>8}\")\n","    print(\"-\"*65)\n","\n","    for key, label, multiplier, unit in metrics:\n","        v1 = c1_overall.get(key, 0) * multiplier\n","        v2 = c2_overall.get(key, 0) * multiplier\n","        delta = v2 - v1\n","        status = chr(0x2191) if delta > 0.01 else (chr(0x2193) if delta < -0.01 else chr(0x2192))\n","        # 時間は逆（短い方が良い）\n","        if key == \"avg_time_sec\":\n","            status = chr(0x2191) if delta < -0.01 else (chr(0x2193) if delta > 0.01 else chr(0x2192))\n","        print(f\"{label:<25} {v1:>9.1f}{unit} {v2:>9.1f}{unit} {delta:>+9.1f}{unit} {status:>8}\")\n","\n","# === C2目標達成判定 ===\n","print(f\"\\n{'='*60}\")\n","print(f\"C2 Target Achievement\")\n","print(f\"{'='*60}\")\n","\n","targets = [\n","    (\"avg_composite_score\", \"Composite Score\", 70.0, 1),\n","    (\"avg_reasoning_score\", \"Reasoning Score\", 3.0, 1),\n","    (\"avg_evidence_score\", \"Evidence Score\", 3.5, 1),\n","    (\"composite_success_rate\", \"Composite Success%\", 0.80, 100),\n","]\n","\n","all_met = True\n","for key, label, target, multiplier in targets:\n","    value = c2_overall.get(key, 0)\n","    display_val = value * multiplier\n","    display_target = target * multiplier\n","    met = value >= target\n","    if not met:\n","        all_met = False\n","    status = chr(0x2705) + \" PASS\" if met else chr(0x274C) + \" MISS\"\n","    print(f\"  {label:<25} {display_val:>8.1f} / {display_target:.1f}  {status}\")\n","\n","print(f\"\\n  Overall: {'ALL TARGETS MET' if all_met else 'SOME TARGETS MISSED'}\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-35","metadata":{"id":"cell-35"},"source":["## 16. レベル別・エリア別 C1 vs C2 比較"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-36","metadata":{"id":"cell-36"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# === レベル別比較 ===\n","if c1_summary:\n","    print(\"=\"*80)\n","    print(\"Hybrid RAG: Level-wise C1 vs C2 Comparison\")\n","    print(\"=\"*80)\n","\n","    c1_by_level = c1_summary.get(\"by_level\", {})\n","    c2_by_level = c2_summary.get(\"by_level\", {})\n","\n","    level_names = {1: \"L1 Basic\", 2: \"L2 Spatial\", 3: \"L3 Constraint\", 4: \"L4 Decision\", 5: \"L5 Advanced\"}\n","\n","    print(f\"{'Level':<15} {'C1 Composite':>12} {'C2 Composite':>12} {'Delta':>8} {'C1 Reasoning':>12} {'C2 Reasoning':>12} {'Delta':>8}\")\n","    print(\"-\"*85)\n","\n","    for level in [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]:\n","        c1_l = c1_by_level.get(level, c1_by_level.get(str(level), {}))\n","        c2_l = c2_by_level.get(level, c2_by_level.get(str(level), {}))\n","\n","        c1_comp = c1_l.get(\"avg_composite_score\", 0)\n","        c2_comp = c2_l.get(\"avg_composite_score\", 0)\n","        c1_reas = c1_l.get(\"avg_reasoning_score\", 0)\n","        c2_reas = c2_l.get(\"avg_reasoning_score\", 0)\n","\n","        print(f\"{level_names.get(level, f'L{level}'):<15} {c1_comp:>12.1f} {c2_comp:>12.1f} {c2_comp-c1_comp:>+8.1f} \"\n","              f\"{c1_reas:>12.2f} {c2_reas:>12.2f} {c2_reas-c1_reas:>+8.2f}\")\n","\n","# === エリア別比較 ===\n","if c1_summary:\n","    print(f\"\\n{'='*80}\")\n","    print(\"Hybrid RAG: Area-wise C1 vs C2 Comparison\")\n","    print(\"=\"*80)\n","\n","    c1_by_area = c1_summary.get(\"by_area\", {})\n","    c2_by_area = c2_summary.get(\"by_area\", {})\n","\n","    print(f\"{'Area':<15} {'C1 Composite':>12} {'C2 Composite':>12} {'Delta':>8} {'C1 Success%':>12} {'C2 Success%':>12} {'Delta':>8}\")\n","    print(\"-\"*80)\n","\n","    for area in sorted(set(list(c1_by_area.keys()) + list(c2_by_area.keys()))):\n","        c1_a = c1_by_area.get(area, {})\n","        c2_a = c2_by_area.get(area, {})\n","\n","        c1_comp = c1_a.get(\"avg_composite_score\", 0)\n","        c2_comp = c2_a.get(\"avg_composite_score\", 0)\n","        c1_succ = c1_a.get(\"success_rate\", 0) * 100\n","        c2_succ = c2_a.get(\"success_rate\", 0) * 100\n","\n","        print(f\"{area:<15} {c1_comp:>12.1f} {c2_comp:>12.1f} {c2_comp-c1_comp:>+8.1f} \"\n","              f\"{c1_succ:>11.1f}% {c2_succ:>11.1f}% {c2_succ-c1_succ:>+7.1f}%\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-37","metadata":{"id":"cell-37"},"source":["## 17. 可視化"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-38","metadata":{"id":"cell-38"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import seaborn as sns\n","\n","plt.rcParams['font.family'] = 'DejaVu Sans'\n","sns.set_style('whitegrid')\n","\n","# --- Fig 1: C1 vs C2 Composite Score by Level ---\n","if c1_summary:\n","    fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(16, 6))\n","\n","    c1_by_level = c1_summary.get(\"by_level\", {})\n","    c2_by_level = c2_summary.get(\"by_level\", {})\n","\n","    levels = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\n","    level_labels = ['L1\\nBasic', 'L2\\nSpatial', 'L3\\nConstraint', 'L4\\nDecision', 'L5\\nAdvanced']\n","    x = np.arange(len(levels))\n","    width = 0.35\n","\n","    c1_scores = [c1_by_level.get(l, c1_by_level.get(str(l), {})).get('avg_composite_score', 0) for l in levels]\n","    c2_scores = [c2_by_level.get(l, c2_by_level.get(str(l), {})).get('avg_composite_score', 0) for l in levels]\n","\n","    bars1 = axes[0].bar(x - width/2, c1_scores, width, label='C1 (Qwen2.5-7B)', color='#3498db', alpha=0.8)\n","    bars2 = axes[0].bar(x + width/2, c2_scores, width, label='C2 (Qwen3-32B)', color='#e74c3c', alpha=0.8)\n","\n","    axes[0].set_xlabel('Level')\n","    axes[0].set_ylabel('Composite Score')\n","    axes[0].set_title('Hybrid RAG: Composite Score by Level (C1 vs C2)')\n","    axes[0].set_xticks(x)\n","    axes[0].set_xticklabels(level_labels)\n","    axes[0].legend()\n","    axes[0].set_ylim([0, 100])\n","    axes[0].axhline(y=70, color='red', linestyle='--', alpha=0.5, label='C2 Target (70)')\n","\n","    # Delta bars\n","    deltas = [c2 - c1 for c1, c2 in zip(c1_scores, c2_scores)]\n","    colors = ['#2ecc71' if d > 0 else '#e74c3c' for d in deltas]\n","    axes[1].bar(x, deltas, color=colors, alpha=0.8)\n","    axes[1].set_xlabel('Level')\n","    axes[1].set_ylabel('Delta (C2 - C1)')\n","    axes[1].set_title('Composite Score Improvement by Level (C1 -> C2)')\n","    axes[1].set_xticks(x)\n","    axes[1].set_xticklabels(level_labels)\n","    axes[1].axhline(y=0, color='black', linestyle='-', alpha=0.3)\n","    for i, d in enumerate(deltas):\n","        axes[1].text(i, d + (1 if d >= 0 else -2), f'{d:+.1f}', ha='center', fontweight='bold')\n","\n","    plt.tight_layout()\n","    plt.savefig(f'{PROJECT_PATH}/results/phase9c_step2_level_comparison.png', dpi=300, bbox_inches='tight')\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","# --- Fig 2: C1 vs C2 Multi-dimensional Scores ---\n","if c1_overall:\n","    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 6))\n","\n","    metrics_list = [\n","        ('Composite\\nScore', c1_overall.get('avg_composite_score', 0), c2_overall.get('avg_composite_score', 0)),\n","        ('Reasoning\\n(x20)', c1_overall.get('avg_reasoning_score', 0)*20, c2_overall.get('avg_reasoning_score', 0)*20),\n","        ('Evidence\\n(x20)', c1_overall.get('avg_evidence_score', 0)*20, c2_overall.get('avg_evidence_score', 0)*20),\n","        ('Success\\nRate', c1_overall.get('composite_success_rate', 0)*100, c2_overall.get('composite_success_rate', 0)*100),\n","    ]\n","\n","    labels = [m[0] for m in metrics_list]\n","    c1_vals = [m[1] for m in metrics_list]\n","    c2_vals = [m[2] for m in metrics_list]\n","\n","    x = np.arange(len(labels))\n","    width = 0.35\n","\n","    ax.bar(x - width/2, c1_vals, width, label='C1 (Qwen2.5-7B)', color='#3498db', alpha=0.8)\n","    ax.bar(x + width/2, c2_vals, width, label='C2 (Qwen3-32B)', color='#e74c3c', alpha=0.8)\n","\n","    ax.set_ylabel('Score (0-100 scale)')\n","    ax.set_title('Hybrid RAG: Multi-dimensional Score Comparison (C1 vs C2)')\n","    ax.set_xticks(x)\n","    ax.set_xticklabels(labels)\n","    ax.legend()\n","    ax.set_ylim([0, 100])\n","\n","    # Add delta labels\n","    for i in range(len(labels)):\n","        delta = c2_vals[i] - c1_vals[i]\n","        max_val = max(c1_vals[i], c2_vals[i])\n","        ax.text(i, max_val + 2, f'{delta:+.1f}', ha='center', fontweight='bold',\n","                color='green' if delta > 0 else 'red')\n","\n","    plt.tight_layout()\n","    plt.savefig(f'{PROJECT_PATH}/results/phase9c_step2_metrics_comparison.png', dpi=300, bbox_inches='tight')\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","# --- Fig 3: C1 vs C2 Area Comparison ---\n","if c1_summary:\n","    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 6))\n","\n","    c1_by_area = c1_summary.get(\"by_area\", {})\n","    c2_by_area = c2_summary.get(\"by_area\", {})\n","\n","    areas = sorted(set(list(c1_by_area.keys()) + list(c2_by_area.keys())))\n","    x = np.arange(len(areas))\n","    width = 0.35\n","\n","    c1_area_scores = [c1_by_area.get(a, {}).get('avg_composite_score', 0) for a in areas]\n","    c2_area_scores = [c2_by_area.get(a, {}).get('avg_composite_score', 0) for a in areas]\n","\n","    ax.bar(x - width/2, c1_area_scores, width, label='C1 (Qwen2.5-7B)', color='#3498db', alpha=0.8)\n","    ax.bar(x + width/2, c2_area_scores, width, label='C2 (Qwen3-32B)', color='#e74c3c', alpha=0.8)\n","\n","    ax.set_xlabel('Area')\n","    ax.set_ylabel('Composite Score')\n","    ax.set_title('Hybrid RAG: Composite Score by Area (C1 vs C2)')\n","    ax.set_xticks(x)\n","    ax.set_xticklabels(areas)\n","    ax.legend()\n","    ax.set_ylim([0, 100])\n","    ax.axhline(y=70, color='red', linestyle='--', alpha=0.5)\n","\n","    for i in range(len(areas)):\n","        delta = c2_area_scores[i] - c1_area_scores[i]\n","        max_val = max(c1_area_scores[i], c2_area_scores[i])\n","        ax.text(i, max_val + 1, f'{delta:+.1f}', ha='center', fontweight='bold', fontsize=9,\n","                color='green' if delta > 0 else 'red')\n","\n","    plt.tight_layout()\n","    plt.savefig(f'{PROJECT_PATH}/results/phase9c_step2_area_comparison.png', dpi=300, bbox_inches='tight')\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","print(\"Visualizations saved\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-39","metadata":{"id":"cell-39"},"source":["## 18. 結果保存（JSON + テキストサマリー）"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-40","metadata":{"id":"cell-40"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["from datetime import datetime\n","\n","timestamp = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\")\n","\n","# numpy型をPython標準型に変換\n","def convert_to_serializable(obj):\n","    if isinstance(obj, (np.integer,)):\n","        return int(obj)\n","    elif isinstance(obj, (np.floating,)):\n","        return float(obj)\n","    elif isinstance(obj, np.ndarray):\n","        return obj.tolist()\n","    elif isinstance(obj, dict):\n","        return {k: convert_to_serializable(v) for k, v in obj.items()}\n","    elif isinstance(obj, list):\n","        return [convert_to_serializable(i) for i in obj]\n","    return obj\n","\n","# JSON結果保存\n","results_data = {\n","    \"experiment\": \"phase9c_step2\",\n","    \"description\": \"Model upgrade evaluation (C1 vs C2: Qwen2.5-7B -> Qwen3-32B)\",\n","    \"timestamp\": timestamp,\n","    \"test_count\": len(full_results[\"hybrid_rag\"]),\n","    \"model\": model_id,\n","    \"model_c1\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 4bit\",\n","    \"model_c2\": model_id,\n","    \"prompt_version\": \"C1 (improved: same as Step 1)\",\n","    \"enable_thinking\": False,\n","    \"systems\": {}\n","}\n","\n","for sys_name, results in full_results.items():\n","    summary = evaluator.generate_summary(results)\n","    results_data[\"systems\"][sys_name] = {\n","        \"summary\": convert_to_serializable(summary),\n","        \"results\": [convert_to_serializable(r.to_dict()) for r in results]\n","    }\n","\n","# C1ベースライン情報も含める\n","if c1_overall:\n","    results_data[\"baseline_c1\"] = convert_to_serializable({\n","        \"source\": c1_file if 'c1_file' in dir() else \"N/A\",\n","        \"summary\": c1_summary\n","    })\n","\n","output_file = f\"{PROJECT_PATH}/results/phase9c_step2_{timestamp}.json\"\n","with open(output_file, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n","    json.dump(results_data, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n","print(f\"Results saved to {output_file}\")\n","\n","# テキストサマリー保存\n","summary_file = f\"{PROJECT_PATH}/results/phase9c_step2_summary_{timestamp}.txt\"\n","with open(summary_file, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n","    f.write(\"Phase 9-C Step 2: Model Upgrade Evaluation Summary\\n\")\n","    f.write(\"=\" * 60 + \"\\n\\n\")\n","    f.write(f\"Date: {datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')}\\n\")\n","    f.write(f\"Test Cases: {results_data['test_count']}\\n\")\n","    f.write(f\"Model C1: {results_data['model_c1']}\\n\")\n","    f.write(f\"Model C2: {results_data['model_c2']}\\n\")\n","    f.write(f\"Prompt: {results_data['prompt_version']}\\n\")\n","    f.write(f\"enable_thinking: {results_data['enable_thinking']}\\n\\n\")\n","\n","    f.write(\"C1 vs C2 Comparison (Hybrid RAG):\\n\")\n","    f.write(\"-\" * 60 + \"\\n\")\n","    if c1_overall:\n","        for key, label in [(\"avg_composite_score\", \"Composite\"), (\"avg_reasoning_score\", \"Reasoning\"),\n","                           (\"avg_evidence_score\", \"Evidence\"), (\"composite_success_rate\", \"CompSuccess%\")]:\n","            v1 = c1_overall.get(key, 0)\n","            v2 = c2_overall.get(key, 0)\n","            mult = 100 if \"rate\" in key else 1\n","            f.write(f\"  {label}: C1={v1*mult:.1f} -> C2={v2*mult:.1f} (delta={((v2-v1)*mult):+.1f})\\n\")\n","\n","    f.write(f\"\\nC2 Target Achievement:\\n\")\n","    f.write(\"-\" * 60 + \"\\n\")\n","    for key, label, target, multiplier in [\n","        (\"avg_composite_score\", \"Composite\", 70.0, 1),\n","        (\"avg_reasoning_score\", \"Reasoning\", 3.0, 1),\n","        (\"avg_evidence_score\", \"Evidence\", 3.5, 1),\n","        (\"composite_success_rate\", \"Success%\", 0.80, 100),\n","    ]:\n","        value = c2_overall.get(key, 0)\n","        met = value >= target\n","        f.write(f\"  {label}: {value*multiplier:.1f} / {target*multiplier:.1f} {'PASS' if met else 'MISS'}\\n\")\n","\n","print(f\"Summary saved to {summary_file}\")\n","print(\"\\nEvaluation complete!\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-41","metadata":{"id":"cell-41"},"source":["## 19. 結論・次ステップ\n","\n","### Step 2 評価結果の要約\n","\n","| 指標 | C1実績 | C2目標 | C2実績 | 判定 |\n","|------|--------|--------|--------|------|\n","| composite | 67.1 | 70+ | **TBD** | TBD |\n","| reasoning | 2.65 | 3.0+ | **TBD** | TBD |\n","| evidence | 3.71 | 3.5+ | **TBD** | TBD |\n","| success% | 76.2% | 80%+ | **TBD** | TBD |\n","\n","### 次ステップ\n","\n","- **C2成功時**: Step 3（プロンプト+モデルの組み合わせ最適化）へ進む\n","- **C2不十分時**:\n","  - 生成パラメータ（temperature, top_p, top_k）のチューニング\n","  - enable_thinking=True での性能確認"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cell-42","metadata":{"id":"cell-42"},"source":["## 20. 結果をGitにコミット & プッシュ\n","\n","評価結果（実行済みノートブック + results/配下のファイル）をリモートブランチにプッシュする。\n","\n","**事前準備**: GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT) が必要。\n","https://github.com/settings/tokens で `repo` スコープのトークンを発行しておく。"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-43","metadata":{"id":"cell-43"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# --- Step A: GitHub PAT認証（再設定）---\n","# Section 0で設定済みだが、Colabセッション中にトークン変数が消えている場合は再入力\n","try:\n","    _ = github_token\n","    print(\"GitHub token already configured (from Section 0)\")\n","except NameError:\n","    from getpass import getpass\n","    github_token = getpass(\"GitHub Personal Access Token: \")\n","    !git -C {PROJECT_PATH} remote set-url origin https://{github_token}@github.com/mopinfish/experiments-local-llm.git\n","    print(\"GitHub authentication re-configured\")"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-44","metadata":{"id":"cell-44"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# --- Step B: リモート最新状態に同期（diverge対応）---\n","!git -C {PROJECT_PATH} fetch origin\n","!git -C {PROJECT_PATH} checkout feature/phase9c-step2-model\n","\n","# rebaseでリモートの変更を取り込み（ローカルコミットをリモートの上に載せる）\n","!git -C {PROJECT_PATH} pull --rebase origin feature/phase9c-step2-model\n","\n","# 現在のブランチを確認\n","!git -C {PROJECT_PATH} branch --show-current"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-45","metadata":{"id":"cell-45"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# --- Step C: ノートブック保存リマインダー + 変更確認 ---\n","print(chr(0x26A0) + \"  このセルを実行する前に Ctrl+S でノートブックを保存してください\")\n","print(\"   （Drive上のファイルが最新の実行結果を含む状態にするため）\")\n","print()\n","\n","# 変更されたファイルを確認\n","!git -C {PROJECT_PATH} status"]},{"cell_type":"code","id":"cell-46","metadata":{"id":"cell-46"},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null,"source":["# --- Step D: ステージング + コミット + プッシュ ---\n","import subprocess\n","\n","# globはPython側で展開してgit addに渡す（シェルglobのCWD問題を回避）\n","import glob as g\n","files_to_add = [f\"notebooks/phase9c_step2_model_evaluation.ipynb\"]\n","files_to_add += [os.path.relpath(f, PROJECT_PATH) for f in g.glob(f\"{PROJECT_PATH}/results/phase9c_step2_*\")]\n","files_to_add += [os.path.relpath(f, PROJECT_PATH) for f in g.glob(f\"{PROJECT_PATH}/results/checkpoint_c2_*\")]\n","\n","print(f\"Files to stage ({len(files_to_add)}):\")\n","for f in files_to_add:\n","    print(f\"  {f}\")\n","    !git -C {PROJECT_PATH} add \"{f}\"\n","\n","print()\n","# ステージング内容を確認\n","!git -C {PROJECT_PATH} diff --cached --stat\n","\n","# コミット\n","!git -C {PROJECT_PATH} commit -m \"results: Phase 9-C Step 2 モデル変更評価結果 (C1 vs C2: Qwen3)\"\n","\n","# プッシュ（rebase付き）\n","!git -C {PROJECT_PATH} pull --rebase origin feature/phase9c-step2-model\n","!git -C {PROJECT_PATH} push origin feature/phase9c-step2-model\n","\n","# 結果確認\n","push_result = !git -C {PROJECT_PATH} log --oneline -1\n","print(f\"\\nLatest commit: {push_result[0] if push_result else 'unknown'}\")\n","!git -C {PROJECT_PATH} status --short\n","print(\"\\n\" + chr(0x2705) + \" 完了\")"]}]}
